{
  "info": {
    "name": "OpsDesk API (Complete & Verified)",
    "description": "Mini ERP + CRM Operations Portal\n\nHow to use:\n1. Set `baseUrl` (defaults to production, change to http://localhost:3001/api for local).\n2. Run 'Auth -> Login - Admin' (or Sales/Accounts/Warehouse).\n3. Token is automatically stored in collection variables.\n4. Run protected requests.\n\nCovers: authentication, CRM, products, inventory, challans, RBAC, validation, business-rule testing, and PDF export.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
